{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Core Game Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your career is built around a clear, addictive cycle of player development and recruitment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit New Prospects:</strong> Scout for the next generation of footballing talent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Academy:</strong> Define training, set tactics, and prepare your young squad for the challenges ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Auto-Battles:</strong> Experience match days with a unique, strategic auto-battler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Action Cards:</strong> Your players earn <strong>Action Cards</strong> from their performance, directly modifying their in-match outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure the Contract:</strong> Successfully develop your stars and appeal to professional clubs to give your players their first pro contract, earning you reputations.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4165060?t=1765347662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165060/09c6e698e35142dc5a200f6cba4b37dd72d3853e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765347662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165060/2f8cbc200f6992ed1166fdf210cfc8c41d27b95f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765347662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165060/2f8cbc200f6992ed1166fdf210cfc8c41d27b95f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765347662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4188700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Core Game Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap